sentencepiece.bpe.model in this directory is distributed under the MIT License.

It is the tokenizer of BAAI/bge-m3 (https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-m3, revision
5617a9f61b028005a4858fdac845db406aefb181). The model repository declares the MIT License but ships no licence
file, so the licence of BAAI's FlagEmbedding (https://github.com/FlagOpen/FlagEmbedding), which publishes bge-m3,
is reproduced below. The sentencepiece model itself originates from XLM-RoBERTa (Meta AI, fairseq,
https://github.com/facebookresearch/fairseq), also under the MIT License, reproduced after it.

